<title>SINGAPORE: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman upgrades SSL.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman upgrades SSL.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said on Monday it has upgraded its rating of property group Straits Steamship Land Ltd (SSL) to a &quot;market outperformer&quot; from a &quot;market performer&quot;.</p>
<p>In its latest research note on SSL, part of the Keppel Corp group, Goldman said it expected SSL's share price to be driven by earnings and upgrades in net asset value (NAV) over the next 12 months.</p>
</text>
